       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-LIE-SE3-RIGGING.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-LIE-SE3-RIGGING-PROOFS.
           05  WS-EXP-MAP-OK               PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RIGID-RIGGING-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-STYLUS-FRAME-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RIGGING-LATENCY-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LIE-SE3-SEAL-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-LIE-SE3-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-SE3-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-SE3-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-EXP-AND-RIGGING.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-STYLUS-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-SE3-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-EXP-AND-RIGGING.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-EXP-MAP-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RIGID-RIGGING-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-STYLUS-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-STYLUS-FRAME-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RIGGING-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-SE3-PROOFS.
           IF WS-EXP-MAP-OK = 1 AND
              WS-RIGID-RIGGING-OK = 1 AND
              WS-STYLUS-FRAME-OK = 1 AND
              WS-RIGGING-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-LIE-SE3-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-SE3-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-SE3-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-SE3-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-SE3-CODE.
